<translation id="4383048845287221326"><ph name="BEGIN_PARAGRAPH1" />Allowing your ChromeOS devices to send automatic reports helps us prioritise what to fix and improve in ChromeOS. These reports can include things like when ChromeOS crashes, which features you use, how much memory you typically use and Android app diagnostic and usage data. Some aggregate data will also help Google apps and partners, such as Android developers.<ph name="END_PARAGRAPH1" />
